<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 18.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 18.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   McIntosh Sec	    11.54   0.78</p>
<p> 2   Villa World	     10.48   1.05</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 10.43   0.94</p>
<p> 4   Indu Property	   10.22   0.89</p>
<p> 5   BT Prop Trust	   10.14   1.61</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 10.01   1.02</p>
<p> 7   Colonial Mutual	  9.89   1.07</p>
<p> 8   Central Equity	   9.38   0.96</p>
<p> 9   Centro Prop		9.20   2.12</p>
<p>10   Gandel Retail Tr	 8.86   0.88</p>
<p>11   Nth Building Soc	 8.78   2.62</p>
<p>12   Gen Prop Tr		8.74   2.30</p>
<p>13   Barclays Mirvac	  8.73   1.26</p>
<p>14   Aust Tour		  8.72   0.86</p>
<p>15   Armstrong Retail	 8.67   0.75</p>
<p>16   Advance Pro CB	   8.66   1.34</p>
<p>17   Westpac Prop Tr	  8.58   1.58</p>
<p>18   Equitilink		 8.47   0.59</p>
<p>19   Natl In Prop	     8.36   1.00</p>
<p>20   Westfield Trust	  8.29   2.34</p>
<p>	  -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
